<title>JAPAN: Nihon Plast shares jump to limit high.</title>
<headline>Nihon Plast shares jump to limit high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Nihon Plast Co Ltd jumped to their limit high in the over-the-counter (OTC) market on Thursday, prompted by a newspaper report the firm will set up a joint venture in South Korea to manufacture steering wheels.</p>
<p>The share price was up 200 yen at 1,520 yen, which made the issue the second-largest percentage gainer in the OTC market by midday.</p>
<p>Volume was 126,000 shares.</p>
<p>Nihon Plast officials were not immediately available for comment on the newspaper report.</p>
